{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"4147","name":"绕尘纪行","desc":"1.5版本纪行","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/19/4521515/063017a5cd5cd43603f38f36940f4f80_3108243251551281790.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"绕尘纪行","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/06/19/4521515/d02181ef18c574d9ded10de923ca944e_8684492708309855566.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"纪行内容","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可以在「绕尘纪行」中获得丰厚的奖励，解锁\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(65,70,75,1)\\\"\u003e「珍珠纪行」或「珍珠之歌」\u003c/span\u003e更可获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e纠缠之缘与指定4星武器\u003c/span\u003e！直接购买珍珠之歌更可获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e纪行专属名片「纪行·绕尘」、摆设图纸「阔面石制炉灶」。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e1.5版本更新后 ~ 2021/06/07 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e●每期纪行活动开启后，大地纪行将默认解锁。旅行者还可通过解锁珍珠纪行或珍珠之歌，获取更丰厚的奖励。直接购买珍珠之歌将享受优惠\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(65,70,75,1)\\\"\u003e。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e※已解锁珍珠纪行的旅行者，如有需要，可补充额外差价以解锁珍珠之歌。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e●从本次纪行起，本周任务中部分任务将进行如下调整：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e删除纪行任务：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 收集100个蒙德区域特产\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 收集100个璃月区域特产\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 完成1次北风狼挑战\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 完成1次风魔龙秘境挑战\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 完成1次「黄金屋」挑战\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e新增纪行任务：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 完成「征讨领域」或「奔狼的领主」挑战总计3次\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 累积获取1000份「洞天宝钱」• 累积制作10份摆设\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e• 在他人「尘歌壶」内，从周游壶灵处购买2个物品\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e※调整前后，完成相关任务可获得的总纪行经验不变。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1319","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\"]}]}","style":""}],"id":"1320","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1321","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1323","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is